# Invariants & contracts
  @invariant  rows 0-indexed, cols 1-indexed, channels 1..16, stops 1-indexed  @ 3
  @invariant  vm.grid is a live handle; rm reads it each frame  @ 4
  @invariant  vm.grid is mutated in place on rebuild, never reassigned  @ 5
  @invariant  rm is pull-only; vm fires no render callbacks  @ 6
  @invariant  rm queries vm.grid / vm:ec() / vm:rowPerBar() each frame  @ 7
  @invariant  writes go via tm (add/assign/delete/flush Event); vm never touches mm  @ 8
  @invariant  vm works in logical time and detune-intent for pitch  @ 9
  @invariant  vm never reads/writes raw pb directly (docs/tuning.md)  @ 10
  @invariant  authoring stamps evt.rpb and evt.ppq = row·logPerRow before tm:addEvent  @ 11
  @invariant  off-grid edits snap evt.ppq to cursor row; delay survives, rpb restamps  @ 12
  @invariant  clipboard encodes rows in source's logical frame; paste decodes against dest's rpb  @ 13
  @invariant  clipboard symmetry is on (row, chan), not absolute ppq  @ 14
  @invariant  grid.chanFirst/Last/lane1Col are chan-keyed; numRows is int  @ 16
  @invariant  selection part names: pitch/vel/delay on note; pb on pb; val on scalar  @ 21
  @contract  resolves same-onset plan collisions in a per-column plan list (mutates in place)  @ 312
  @invariant  fromLogical is monotone but not isotone; two logical onsets can round onto one raw ppq  @ 313
  @contract  later-source-ppq plan (curr by tie-break) shifts up 1 ppq, else predecessor shifts back  @ 314
  @invariant  tail overlaps NOT resolved here; tm's universal tail pass owns every raw note-off  @ 315
  @contract  skips non-note plans/cols; optional `deleted` event-set excluded from the walk  @ 316
  @invariant  deleted corpses still live in col.events snapshot until next rebuild  @ 317
  @invariant  a freshly placed note is unbounded: endppq = util.OPEN, no authored ceiling  @ 747
  @invariant  universal tail pass derives the real tail (next onset/take length) each rebuild  @ 748
  @contract  caller pre-pins (ppq, ppqL, rpb) onto `update` before calling  @ 749
  @contract  col nil only for a chord sprout (no column yet): no prev-vel to inherit, lane pre-set  @ 750
  @invariant  notes ordered by entry; members re-resolved via cells[row], never held event refs  @ 1075
  @contract  arms on a note col's first pitch stop; pins (row, chan) until shift release  @ 1095
  @contract  returns true iff consumed; false lets the drain fall through (to value-digit entry)  @ 1096
  @contract  re-striking a gesture pitch toggles it off; freed slots are reused lowest-first  @ 1097
  @contract  spreadChan strikes walk channels up from home; plain strikes stack home-channel lanes  @ 1098
  @invariant  pins (col,row,part); overwrites a place keep-below, steps the sub-caret right  @ 1216
  @invariant  field re-read via cells[row] each keystroke; undo snapshots drive backspace-restore  @ 1217
  @contract  selection must be exactly one grid column; multi-col selection is a no-op  @ 2707
  @invariant  a 1-col block stays contiguous when it lands on the destination col  @ 2708
  @contract  cursor follows to the destination column (single event and selection alike)  @ 2709
  @contract  refuse if dest col has any onset in source's row extent (note: note-on; else any event)  @ 2710
  @invariant  source's row extent = selection's [r1,r2] for a block, moved event's onset row for a single  @ 2711
  @invariant  tails (either direction) clipped by tm's tail pass; never block  @ 2712
  @contract  reentrancy-guarded; bails on no-take (page shows placeholder)  @ 3648
  @contract  takeChanged=true resets ec and re-reads resolution/length/timeSigs  @ 3649
  @contract  grid + ctx rebuild each call; pushMute at end  @ 3650
  @contract  a column's cells/ghosts carry while its events table + projection epoch are unchanged  @ 3651
  @contract  tv consumes configChanged only for transient-frame release and mute pulse  @ 3962
  @contract  rebuild is driven by tm's 'rebuild' signal — closes the (cm, tm) double-fire race  @ 3963
  @contract  non-transient FRAME_KEYS write while transient override active routes into releaseTransientFrame  @ 3964
  @invariant  releaseTransientFrame's cm:assign fires configChanged → tm:rebuild → tv:rebuild  @ 3965

